WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.409
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.730
 When I was a young gymnast,
I was exactly like you.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.860
I had a lot of love and
passion for this sport,

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.238
but little Simone, she just
flailed her body in the air

00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:28.530
and just thought it was the
greatest thing of all time.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.390
And I needed to
work on my technique

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:32.540
and fundamental
skills to improve.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.420
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.980
Whenever I was
younger, I was always

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.610
the type of gymnast to be,
like, lollygagging around.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.860
And I'm like, oh my god,
it's my turn, let's go.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.230
I learned discipline
inside the gym.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:00.150
In this MasterClass, I want
to show you the fundamentals,

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:04.530
from basics to advanced skills.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:08.370
I will also demonstrate more
advanced and elite skills.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.170
Initiate your twist
with your feet,

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.150
then hips, then shoulders.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.710
No matter what skill you
execute off the table,

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:18.420
it's really important to block
first, rise, and then twist.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.890
ANNOUNCER: Now on uneven
bars, Simone Biles.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:22.372
[CHEERING AND APPLAUSE]

00:01:23.638 --> 00:01:25.930
 Honestly, right there, I
was thinking don't screw up.

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:27.760
I'm literally
terrified right now.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.190
I'm already struggling, and
you can see I'm rushing.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.130
My hands weren't completely
placed on the bars.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.100
You always have to go through
and finish whatever performance

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:36.910
you're doing.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:39.580
If you're not nervous once
you go out to compete,

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.402
then something's wrong.

00:01:41.402 --> 00:01:43.710
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.480
Keep working hard in the gym.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.090
Communicate what you
want from your coaches.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.830
And always remember, that these
things don't happen overnight.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.160
It takes a lot of work
to get to where we are.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.050
But with practice
and confidence,

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:57.390
you can accomplish
your dreams, too.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.940
I'm Simone Biles, and
this is my MasterClass.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:04.590
[MUSIC PLAYING]

